Absolutely — that's actually **better architecture**. The foundation dataset should be pristine and internally reconciled. Then your app can have a separate process that **corrupts/copies selected records** to create the "messy ERP export" for the data-cleaning demo.

 That way you always have a **golden source of truth** to test against.

