 # Generate a Large, Perfectly Reconciled ERP-Style Canadian Accounting Dataset

 I am building a portfolio application to demonstrate technical accounting, data processing, reconciliation, month-end close, financial reporting, financial analysis, and accounting-system skills for Junior/Intermediate/Staff Accountant roles in Calgary, Alberta.

 I want you to generate a **large, realistic, perfectly internally consistent Excel workbook** that will serve as the foundational "golden dataset" for my application.

 This is the **clean source-of-truth dataset**.

 Do NOT introduce errors, duplicates, missing values, inconsistent formatting, invalid GST, incorrect account mappings, or reconciliation discrepancies into this version.

 I will create a separate data-corruption/cleaning layer later that intentionally introduces problems into copies of this data.

 The goal is to create a miniature but realistic accounting/ERP environment that could plausibly exist behind a medium-sized Canadian company's accounting system.

 The data should support this workflow:

 **ERP Source Data → Accounting Processing → Subledgers → General Ledger → Reconciliations → Month-End Close → Trial Balance → Financial Statements → Variance Analysis → Management Reporting → Audit Support**

